    {
      "id": "cn.civil-code.article-1042",
      "legalDomain": "marriage_family",
      "lawName": "中华人民共和国民法典",
      "articleNumber": "第一千零四十二条",
      "articleText": "禁止包办、买卖婚姻和其他干涉婚姻自由的行为。禁止借婚姻索取财物。\n\n禁止重婚。禁止有配偶者与他人同居。\n\n禁止家庭暴力。禁止家庭成员间的虐待和遗弃。",
      "articleTextSha256": "96477ea3b845d1b2ac7d58a9b275c83aa36e6b28f074a659768dedbe488769ec",
      "publicationDate": "2020-05-28",
      "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
      "status": "effective",
      "topics": ["marriage_freedom", "bigamy", "domestic_violence"],
      "source": {
        "authority": "全国人大常委会办公厅国家法律法规数据库",
        "metadataUrl": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?fileId=&id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf&title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8&type=",
        "textAuthority": "工业和信息化部天津市通信管理局",
        "textUrl": "https://tjca.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/flfg/art/2020/art_20cf1a2e1b854924b5caa744c8045d1f.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cn.civil-code.article-1079",
      "legalDomain": "marriage_family",
      "lawName": "中华人民共和国民法典",
      "articleNumber": "第一千零七十九条",
      "articleText": "夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。\n\n人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n有下列情形之一，调解无效的，应当准予离婚：\n\n（一）重婚或者与他人同居；\n\n（二）实施家庭暴力或者虐待、遗弃家庭成员；\n\n（三）有赌博、吸毒等恶习屡教不改；\n\n（四）因感情不和分居满二年；\n\n（五）其他导致夫妻感情破裂的情形。\n\n一方被宣告失踪，另一方提起离婚诉讼的，应当准予离婚。\n\n经人民法院判决不准离婚后，双方又分居满一年，一方再次提起离婚诉讼的，应当准予离婚。",
      "articleTextSha256": "c5f128824cb6c10029a5265bfc75fa4f1ff0bb0c0d6269202328bbae74475e79",
      "publicationDate": "2020-05-28",
      "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
      "status": "effective",
      "topics": ["judicial_divorce", "marital_breakdown", "domestic_violence"],
      "retrievalEnabled": false,
      "source": {
        "authority": "全国人大常委会办公厅国家法律法规数据库",
        "metadataUrl": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?fileId=&id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf&title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8&type=",
        "textAuthority": "工业和信息化部天津市通信管理局",
        "textUrl": "https://tjca.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/flfg/art/2020/art_20cf1a2e1b854924b5caa744c8045d1f.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cn.civil-code.article-1062",
      "legalDomain": "marriage_family",
      "lawName": "中华人民共和国民法典",
      "articleNumber": "第一千零六十二条",
      "articleText": "夫妻在婚姻关系存续期间所得的下列财产，为夫妻的共同财产，归夫妻共同所有：\n\n（一）工资、奖金、劳务报酬；\n\n（二）生产、经营、投资的收益；\n\n（三）知识产权的收益；\n\n（四）继承或者受赠的财产，但是本法第一千零六十三条第三项规定的除外；\n\n（五）其他应当归共同所有的财产。\n\n夫妻对共同财产，有平等的处理权。",
      "articleTextSha256": "b94017bc33214890cd06f6c8b08fc882781b48b8255309230fad51346c425cb2",
      "publicationDate": "2020-05-28",
      "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
      "status": "effective",
      "topics": ["marital_common_property", "equal_disposition"],
      "retrievalEnabled": false,
      "source": {
        "authority": "全国人大常委会办公厅国家法律法规数据库",
        "metadataUrl": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?fileId=&id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf&title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8&type=",
        "textAuthority": "工业和信息化部天津市通信管理局",
        "textUrl": "https://tjca.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/flfg/art/2020/art_20cf1a2e1b854924b5caa744c8045d1f.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cn.civil-code.article-675",
      "legalDomain": "private_lending",
      "lawName": "中华人民共和国民法典",
      "articleNumber": "第六百七十五条",
      "articleText": "借款人应当按照约定的期限返还借款。对借款期限没有约定或者约定不明确，依据本法第五百一十条的规定仍不能确定的，借款人可以随时返还；贷款人可以催告借款人在合理期限内返还。",
      "articleTextSha256": "9b8f9549e207f49e6f19231aec0f2b9feab216eedc784dbdd4ba4d09262fb786",
      "publicationDate": "2020-05-28",
      "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
      "status": "effective",
      "topics": ["repayment_term", "repayment_demand"],
      "source": {
        "authority": "全国人大常委会办公厅国家法律法规数据库",
        "metadataUrl": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?fileId=&id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf&title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8&type=",
        "textAuthority": "工业和信息化部天津市通信管理局",
        "textUrl": "https://tjca.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/flfg/art/2020/art_20cf1a2e1b854924b5caa744c8045d1f.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cn.civil-code.article-676",
      "legalDomain": "private_lending",
      "lawName": "中华人民共和国民法典",
      "articleNumber": "第六百七十六条",
      "articleText": "借款人未按照约定的期限返还借款的，应当按照约定或者国家有关规定支付逾期利息。",
      "articleTextSha256": "189c946273bb1de2e445a35b7d5473cf972fd80ef89a1303114d35cb06e2ff03",
      "publicationDate": "2020-05-28",
      "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
      "status": "effective",
      "topics": ["overdue_interest"],
      "retrievalEnabled": false,
      "source": {
        "authority": "全国人大常委会办公厅国家法律法规数据库",
        "metadataUrl": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?fileId=&id=ff808081729d1efe01729d50b5c500bf&title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8E%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E5%85%B1%E5%92%8C%E5%9B%BD%E6%B0%91%E6%B3%95%E5%85%B8&type=",
        "textAuthority": "工业和信息化部天津市通信管理局",
        "textUrl": "https://tjca.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/flfg/art/2020/art_20cf1a2e1b854924b5caa744c8045d1f.html"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cn.civil-code.article-680",
      "legalDomain": "private_lending",
      "lawName": "中华人民共和国民法典",
      "articleNumber": "第六百八十条",
      "articleText": "禁止高利放贷，借款的利率不得违反国家有关规定。\n\n借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息。\n\n借款合同对支付利息约定不明确，当事人不能达成补充协议的，按照当地或者当事人的交易方式、交易习惯、市场利率等因素确定利息；自然人之间借款的，视为没有利息。",
      "articleTextSha256": "1e98d77beebb2b57f64f12058b6fc2bba060bd5dfa5fae7b1552d53200b37454",
      "publicationDate": "2020-05-28",
      "effectiveDate": "2021-01-01",
      "status": "effective",
      "topics": ["usury_prohibition", "interest_agreement"],
      "retrievalEnabled": false,
      "source": {
